I did the port of NetHack 1.4f with some help from Michael Kahl from
the THINK Technologies division of Symantec Corporation.  I also did the
port of NetHack 2.3e.  The binaries for 2.3e were posted many months ago.

If you want the binaries, I believe that BMUG (Berkeley Mac Users Group)
has it on their diskettes.  Or try looking at FTP sites.  Or if truly
desparate, send me mail and perhaps something can be arranged.

There have been numerous requests for sources.  I would post them but for the
custom Lightspeed C libraries and modifications to the stdio libraries 
(these versions were ported with Lightspeed C 2.15)

I have no connection with Symantec Corporation except as a customer.
